<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Lehman raises Tate &amp; Lyle.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Lehman raises Tate &amp; Lyle.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tate &amp; Lyle Plc was raised to a &quot;buy&quot; at Lehman Brothers, the investment bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>In a research note, analayst Richard Newboult said he believed the sugar group was on the verge of a major turnaround driven by a recovery in three of its largest businesses.</p>
<p>First half results due May 7 were expected to be weak but this would mark a trough in group profits. Throughout the rest of the decade a strong recovery in earnings was expected, Newboult said.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
